!!!****Common interpolation parameters for all variables****!!!
0.0d0                                   !EXTERNAL_X_INIT:               initial x position for interpolation
0.0d0                                 !EXTERNAL_Z_INIT:               initial z position for interpolation
0.0125d0                                  !EXTERNAL_DELTA:                uniform grid spacing for interpolation
